    "stem": "Mihir shades a unit square. He takes $\\frac{1}{4}$ of the square and then $\\frac{1}{2}$ of that quarter to show $\\frac{1}{4}\\times\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nWhich reading of the shaded product is correct?",
