    "options": {
      "A": "Call the rectangle area the product label, and stop before linking it to the shaded fraction of the unit square.",
      "B": "Shade $\\frac{1}{4}\\times\\frac{1}{2}$ even if the whole region is not the unit square.",
      "C": "The shaded piece is $\\frac{1}{8}$ of the unit square, because one half of one quarter is one eighth.",
      "D": "Use the same shading story to find the perimeter of the unit square."
